  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::HowToPlayPanel
  m_Instructions: '1. Point the phone at the floor. The basket follows the middle of the screen.


    2. Move the basket under the falling fruit. The ring on the floor shows where each one will land.


    3. A red ring means a rotten apple: let it fall.


    4. Three misses end the round.'
  m_SafetyNote: Make sure the space around you is clear, and keep an eye on your surroundings while you play.
